  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven": "Inner Haven",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.description": "Hold it to fade into your inner self: a room of stillness that is yours alone. Your body waits where you stood. Use it again to return. Each crossing costs 2 charges; one returns every ten minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.epithet": "the Stillness Below",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude": "Interlude",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.description": "Right click to step out of step with the world: everything around you moves at half its pace while you do not, and you leave yourself behind in fading images. It burns a charge every two seconds; switched off, its charge returns.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.epithet": "the Slower Sky",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.power": "Slows to %s%% for up to %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.numinor_ingot": "Numinor Ingot",
  "item.abyssaldepths.numinor_nugget": "Numinor Nugget",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion": "Oblivion",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion.description": "Hold it to turn the world away from everything around you: all that lives within twenty-four blocks is cast into the shadow of this world for thirty seconds, unseen and unheard, left to itself and whatever else is there. The mightiest slip back sooner. One charge; it returns after thirty minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion.epithet": "the Turning Away",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax": "Parallax",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.description": "Right click to slip into the shadow of this world. There you walk where you stood, unseen and untouchable, and nothing you reach for answers: you cannot take, break, use or harm. There is only one shadow; whoever else steps into it will find you there. It burns a charge every six seconds; switched off, its charge returns.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.epithet": "the Other Side of Light",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.power": "Lasts up to %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise": "Reprise",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.description": "While you carry it, the world keeps its last two minutes. Hold it, and everything goes back to how it was then: the stone, the beasts, every soul in it. Only Reprise remembers. One charge; it returns after thirty minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.epithet": "the Measure Played Again",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.power": "Reaches %s s back",
  "item.abyssaldepths.sulfur": "Sulfur",
